        "content_json": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Problem:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold",
                      "attrs": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "trail update",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "attrs": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " command only worked with trails that already had a branch—either by selecting via ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "--branch",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code",
                      "attrs": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " or defaulting to the current branch. This made it impossible to update branchless trails or to change which branch a trail points at.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Solution:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold",
                      "attrs": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bulletList",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Added ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "--trail",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " flag to select a trail by number, id, or branch. This is the only way to reach a branchless trail, which has no branch name to match.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Added ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "--set-branch",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " flag to change the trail's branch pointer. For trails that already have a branch, this renames it via the metadata PATCH endpoint. For branchless trails, it attaches a branch through a new ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "/branch",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " endpoint.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Added ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "--branch-action",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " flag to control how a branch is attached to a branchless trail: ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "link",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " (attach an already-pushed branch) or ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "create",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " (backfill it on the forge at the trail's base commit).",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "New API types ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "TrailBranchRequest",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " and ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "TrailBranchResponse",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " model the ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "/branch",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " endpoint behavior.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Updated the command logic to route ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "--set-branch",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " requests appropriately: POST to ",
                          "type": "text"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "/branch",
                          "type": "text",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " for branchless trails (produces output immediately), or fold the branch into the metadata PATCH for existing-branch trails.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Added tests covering branch attachment, response decoding, and flag validation.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ]
        },
        "text_snapshot": "Problem:\nThe trail update command only worked with trails that already had a branch—either by selecting via --branch or defaulting to the current branch. This made it impossible to update branchless trails or to change which branch a trail points at.\nSolution:\nAdded --trail flag to select a trail by number, id, or branch. This is the only way to reach a branchless trail, which has no branch name to match.\nAdded --set-branch flag to change the trail's branch pointer. For trails that already have a branch, this renames it via the metadata PATCH endpoint. For branchless trails, it attaches a branch through a new /branch endpoint.\nAdded --branch-action flag to control how a branch is attached to a branchless trail: link (attach an already-pushed branch) or create (backfill it on the forge at the trail's base commit).\nNew API types TrailBranchRequest and TrailBranchResponse model the /branch endpoint behavior.\nUpdated the command logic to route --set-branch requests appropriately: POST to /branch for branchless trails (produces output immediately), or fold the branch into the metadata PATCH for existing-branch trails.\nAdded tests covering branch attachment, response decoding, and flag validation.",
