              "rationale": "Small, well-tested feature scoped to `entire trail update`; user-supplied branch names are validated via ValidateBranchName/git check-ref-format before use, paths interpolate only integer trail numbers, and there are no dependency, CI, auth, hook, or redaction changes.",
              "run_id": "019f4717-1041-7991-9904-17f83c863c47",
              "head_sha": "14c8e507e0bcc674465e9151479a103d242ca705",
              "updated_at": "2026-07-09T13:36:34.997Z"
            },
            {
              "percent_value": 8,
              "size_value": null,
              "boolean_value": null,
              "rationale": "Focused, well-tested feature adding branch flags to `entire trail update`; no dependency/CI/redaction/auth changes, and user-supplied branch names are validated via git check-ref-format while trail IDs are integer-typed or matched client-side, leaving no injection, leakage, or access-control surface.",
              "run_id": "019f470b-155f-7c92-af14-61ff414862db",
              "head_sha": "0385bb234f79f8c2327ddf4835e3cd087ec9873e",
              "updated_at": "2026-07-09T13:23:51.219Z"
            }
          ],
          "run_id": "019f4717-1041-7991-9904-17f83c863c47",
          "head_sha": "14c8e507e0bcc674465e9151479a103d242ca705",
