        {
          "key": "drift",
          "label": "Drift",
          "value_type": "percent",
          "percent_value": 8,
          "size_value": null,
          "boolean_value": null,
          "rationale": "Tightly-scoped extension of the existing hidden `trail update` subcommand that reuses established helpers (resolveTrailBySelector, client.Post/Patch, checkTrailResponse, ValidateBranchName), adds API types to the existing trail_types.go with matching style, uses explicit wrapped errors, and includes parallel httptest-based tests. No new top-level verbs, no new dependencies, no abstraction bypasses.",
