              "boolean_value": null,
              "rationale": "Tightly-scoped extension of the existing hidden `trail update` subcommand that reuses established helpers (resolveTrailBySelector, client.Post/Patch, checkTrailResponse, ValidateBranchName), adds API types to the existing trail_types.go with matching style, uses explicit wrapped errors, and includes parallel httptest-based tests. No new top-level verbs, no new dependencies, no abstraction bypasses.",
              "run_id": "019f4717-0fff-726b-9bd9-f91e3dc18a30",
              "head_sha": "14c8e507e0bcc674465e9151479a103d242ca705",
              "updated_at": "2026-07-09T13:36:23.218Z"
            },
            {
              "percent_value": 8,
              "size_value": null,
              "boolean_value": null,
              "rationale": "The change extends the existing hidden `trail update` command with branch-setting flags, reusing established helpers (resolveTrailBySelector, checkTrailResponse, client.Post/Patch), matching API-type and error-handling conventions, adding no new dependencies, and including parallel httptest-based tests. It stays fully scoped to its stated purpose with no structural deviation.",
              "run_id": "019f470b-1d75-78e9-be64-5c90641eec9a",
              "head_sha": "0385bb234f79f8c2327ddf4835e3cd087ec9873e",
              "updated_at": "2026-07-09T13:23:19.140Z"
