              "rationale": "Adds forge-side trail metadata flags (--set-branch/--trail/--branch-action) and a /branch API endpoint in the contained trail command; no local git mutation, no destructive ops, no strategy/hooks/redaction/transcript code, and egress is limited to metadata in authenticated API calls. The only remote side effect is a server-mediated forge branch create behind an explicit flag, which cannot corrupt the local repo.",
